# ESPN authentication cookies — required for private leagues.
#
# How to get them:
#   1. Log into fantasy.espn.com in your browser
#   2. DevTools (F12) -> Application tab -> Cookies -> https://fantasy.espn.com
#   3. Copy the values for `espn_s2` and `SWID`
#
# These expire periodically. If `ff.py doctor` starts failing auth, re-copy them.
ESPN_S2=
SWID=
